; claude: a 2D physics engine, from scratch, for teaching computational
; physics: one idea per module, each .mli with its diagram, worked
; example and references (see docs/claude_notes/plan_physics_teaching.md
; and notes_2d_physics.md). Independent of the Playground. A private
; library (see graphics/core/dune), installed as part of elm_playground:
; pure OCaml, so every backend, the web one included, can use it.
(library
 (name physics_2d)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries graphics_2d_geometry) ; Vec2
)
